  "body": "Top School Zones, Freehold site, Brick and tile, Bright and Sunny, this spacious Browns Bay home offers an excellent combination of family living, flexibility and location.\r\n\r\nFeaturing 5 bedrooms, 2 lounges, 1 dining room, 3 bathrooms plus an additional toilet, and two master bedrooms. The downstairs master has its own separate entrance, offering excellent potential for separate rental, extended family or guests.\r\n\r\nEnjoy a quality kitchen with Bosch appliances, DVS system, Underfloor heating, Central vacuum system, Double Glazing, SPA and the convenience of being within walking distance to the beach. \r\n\r\nZoned for highly sought-after Rangitoto College , Northcross Intermediate and Murrays Bay Intermediate .\r\n\r\n5 Bedrooms | 2 Master Bedrooms | 2 Lounges | 1 Dining Room | 3.5 Bathrooms | Full Freehold Site | Separate Entrance | Walk to the Beach\r\n\r\nFeel free to text Chen anytime on 020 478 1818 to arrange a private viewing. Text messages are preferred.",
